        "original_id": "fee4b71e-f597-5c4f-931d-d0dbb71ced82",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Isaiah Mustafa, Terry Crews, Stacy Keibler, Mark Fitzloff\n- Campaigns: Make a Smellmitment\n- Brands: Old Spice, Nike, Coca-Cola, Procter & Gamble\n- Organizations: Wieden+Kennedy, CIA, NFL\n- TV Episodes/Series: Chuck Versus the A-Team, Chuck\n\nFacts:\n- Isaiah Amir Mustafa was born on February 11, 1974, and he is an American actor and former NFL practice squad wide receiver.\n- Mark Fitzloff is best known for his work at Wieden+Kennedy on Nike and Coca-Cola and for reviving Procter & Gamble's Old Spice brand.\n- The \"Make a Smellmitment\" campaign retained much of the format of the previous campaign, including its characters played by Isaiah Mustafa and Terry Crews.\n- In \"Chuck Versus the A-Team,\" Chuck fears that the CIA's new operatives, played by Isaiah Mustafa and Stacy Keibler, will render him obsolete after downloading the Intersect.",
